    <text><body><div type="letter"><opener><salute>Nobilissimo viro <rs corresp="Lubieniecki_Stanislaw" type="person">Stanislao Lubienietzki</rs> de Lubi <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="3" unit="chars"/></del> <add place="superlinear">enietze</add> <lb/> <rs corresp="Boulliau" type="person">Ismaël Bullialdus</rs> <choice><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr> <expan>salutem plurimam dicit</expan></choice></salute></opener> <p><pb facs="https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b90612192/f527" n="254r"/>Quamvis tot circumstantiis accurate notatis in scripta ad me epistola <del rendition="#s">m</del> ad revocandam <add place="superlinear">in mentem meam</add> tui memoriam, loca et tempora, <del rendition="#s">quibus</del> <add place="superlinear">cum vicissim</add> nobis uterque primum innotuimus, non designasses ac significasses, solum nomen tuum ad id efficiendum sufficiebat. Mihi quippe illud non excidit; <del rendition="#s">illud</del> quod aliquoties in <rs corresp="Polen" type="place">Polonia</rs> et <rs corresp="ed_unv_py2_dlb" type="place">Prussia</rs> praedicatum audivi; et de te etiam illis in locis <del rendition="#ow">sermo <add place="superlinear">3</add> aliquando<add place="superlinear">4</add> inter<add place="superlinear">1</add> confabulandum<add place="superlinear">2</add> incidit<add place="superlinear">5</add></del> <add place="intralinear">inter confabulandum sermo aliquando incidit</add>, <del rendition="#s">et</del> de rerum tuarum ac valetudinis statu <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="chars"/></del> cum se occasio obtulit, curiosius <del rendition="#ow">percunctatus sum</del> <add place="intralinear">sum percunctatus.</add> Neque porro excusationes <del rendition="#s">opu</del> aliquas mihi <del rendition="#s">cui nihil debes</del> cui<del rendition="#s">que</del> nullo nomine es obnoxius, aferre debes: Quod vero ad me scripseris tuae humanitatis ac comitatis erga me testimonium accipio, certumque signum mihi datum existimo. <rs type="term" corresp="ed_ytl_jnm_k4b">Commercium litterarum tecum exercere</rs> valde cuperem; sed saepissime mihi accidit, ut <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="words"/></del> nullius etiam momenti negotia et a studiis, et <add place="superlinear">a</add> literis ad amicos scribendis me avocent. Hac propterea conditione illud inter nos <del rendition="#s">hac conditione</del> institui vellem, ut rescribendi statim nulla necessitas utrique imponeretur, possetque uterque in horas commediores responsa sua <add place="superlinear">uterque</add> differre; Quod sine <choice><abbr>ambor.</abbr> <expan>amborum</expan></choice> detrimento pacisci possumus, cum de pecuniis collybi schedulis a trapezistis reperendis non agatur; neque etiam negotia publica a nobis sint <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="words"/></del> nisi historice tractanda.</p> <p>Gratias tibi maximas habeo de communicatis mecum <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="chars"/></del> <rs corresp="Polen" type="place">Polonici regni</rs> tot gravissimi momenti rebus. Turbatas tam <add place="superlinear">diu</add> videre <add place="superlinear">eas</add> mihi molestissimum est; nec quid boni sperandum sit satis pervidere possum. Tot enim suspicionibus aemulationibusque mutuis animos procerumque omniumque nobilium jactatos agitatosque scio, ut illos sedari placidosque brevi reddi posse vix sit sperandum. Omnium vero pessimum maximeque exitiosum est, quod dissidiis ac discordia laboranti ac tantum non scisso regno <rs corresp="ed_pfc_31d_kfb" type="place">Turcae</rs> aliique hostes ingruant, praedamque sibi paratam jam jam fore barbari illi credant, et ad rapiendam illam se se apparent devorandumque. Discordiam illam <pb facs="https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b90612192/f528" n="254v"/>vicinorum quidam fovent, falsisque rumoribus sparsis animos percellunt, ac seducunt. Cum tibi opportunum <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="chars"/></del> <add place="superlinear">erit ac</add> per otium licebit, nuntiorum qui tibi afferentur participem si feceris <del rendition="#s">obnoxium</del> <add place="superlinear">valde devinctum tibi me</add> quoque <del rendition="#s">valde</del> habebis.</p> <p>Pauca apud nos, qui profunda quiete, firmaque pace fruimus, quibusque sub <rs corresp="ed_q5k_vhs_52b" type="person">rege felicissimo ac potentissimo</rs> prospere ac secundo cursu omnia fluunt, <del rendition="#s">nunc</del> palam nunc geruntur; <add place="superlinear">de</add> arcanis enim et principis secretis consiliis privati non inquirimus. Cursor huc pridie Paschatis rediit, qui ad <rs corresp="ed_kpk_yrb_kfb" type="person">summum <choice><abbr>pontif.</abbr> <expan>pontificem</expan></choice></rs> <del rendition="#s">spon</del> legati <rs corresp="zdx_lgx_12b" type="place">Veneti</rs>, legationisque <rs corresp="ed_nqr_bgk_kfb" type="place">Hispanicae</rs> secretarii sponsionem scripto contentam, qua <rs corresp="ed_q5k_vhs_52b" type="person">Regi <choice><abbr>christianiss.</abbr> <expan>christianissimo</expan></choice></rs> cave<del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="3" unit="chars"/></del> <add place="superlinear">runt</add> <del rendition="#s"><unclear cert="high" reason="covered"/>sanctum</del> illum <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="words"/></del> <add place="superlinear">ipsi</add> satisfacturum, <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="chars"/></del>pertulerat; quod factum, ut <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="chars"/></del> ad componendam controversiam colloquium denuo institueretur. Attulit nuncios cursor, <choice><abbr>summ. pontif.</abbr> <expan><rs corresp="ed_kpk_yrb_kfb" type="person">summum pontificem</rs></expan></choice> praelatum Romanum quendam <rs corresp="Rasponi" type="person">Rasponem</rs> appellatum <del rendition="#s"><unclear cert="high" reason="covered">Lugdunum</unclear></del> cum <del rendition="#s"><unclear cert="high" reason="covered">pac</unclear></del> facultate pacificandae rixae plenaria absque mora <rs corresp="ncx_lgx_12b" type="place">Lugdunum</rs> missurum. Illuc quoque dominus dux <rs corresp="ed_qdx_lbz_1lb" type="person">Crequius</rs>, <del rendition="#s">ceter</del> ut <del rendition="#s">advenientem praelatum</del> temporis compendium faciat, eodem tempore adventurus est. <del rendition="#s">Ill</del> Colloqui ergo illius expectandus erit exitus. Interim vero <rs corresp="ed_q5k_vhs_52b" type="person">rex</rs> aut de successu nondum certus, aut aliud animo consilium volvens, quendam rei militaris peritissimum ad explorandas vias, ac loca <choice><abbr>castror.</abbr> <expan>castrorum</expan></choice> locationis <add place="superlinear">metationi,</add> proxime <rs corresp="Casale" type="place">Casalium</rs> <add place="superlinear">etiam</add> opportuna in <rs corresp="Italien" type="place">Italiam</rs> dimisit. Daniae <del rendition="#s">principem</del> <rs corresp="ed_egg_cvq_tgb" type="person">princeps</rs> <rs corresp="ed_h1c_jhj_4kb" type="person">domicellam Aurelianensem virginem illam principem</rs>, demortui <rs corresp="ed_nks_13j_4kb" type="person">ducis <choice><abbr>Aurelian.</abbr> <expan>Aurelianensis</expan></choice></rs>natu maximam filiarum, ad <choice><abbr>Sti</abbr> <expan>Sancti</expan></choice> Ferreali fanum <rs corresp="SaintFargeau" type="place">(St Fargeau)</rs> ubi illa nunc degit, permittente rege invisit. Plebs illico <rs corresp="Paris" type="place">Parisiensis</rs> connubium inter eos contrahendum esse rumoribus distulit. De <rs corresp="Falquet" type="person">Falqueti</rs> causa brevi agendum a commisariis <del rendition="#s">vulgo fertur</del> <add place="superlinear">et de illius <unclear reason="illegible"><gap quantity="1" unit="words"/></unclear> inquiretur. Cito</add> tamen tantum negotium, valde implicitum <unclear cert="low" reason="illegible">tricis</unclear>, formulisque observandis involutum, expediri nequit.</p> <p>Quod <add place="superlinear">cum</add> domino <choice><sic><rs type="person" corresp="Rautenstein">Rautenstenstenio</rs></sic> <reg><rs corresp="Rautenstein" type="person">Rautenstenio</rs></reg></choice> <rs type="term" corresp="ed_a3h_hzy_3fb">amicitia</rs> tibi intercedat valde laetor. Is enim vir optimus, doctissimus, multarumque rerum peritissimus est. <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="chars"/></del> Primis literis quod de illa <rs corresp="Beaugency" type="person">Anna Maria de Beaugenci</rs>, mihi <choice><abbr>oio</abbr> <expan>omnino</expan></choice> <add place="intralinear">ignota</add> comperero, ad te scribam. <add place="superlinear">#</add> Hanc epistolam ad dominum <rs corresp="Bidallius" type="person">Bidallium</rs> prout monuisti dirigo.</p> <p>Vale Vir <choice><abbr>Illme.</abbr> <expan>Illustrissime</expan></choice> et ad <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="chars"/></del> officia quaecumque tibi exhibenda paratum me <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="2" unit="chars"/></del> crede.</p> <p><pb facs="https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b90612192/f529" n="255r"/> <note hand="#author" place="right"><foreign xml:lang="fra"><seg type="comment"><orig><add place="right">Testament du Cardinal <rs corresp="Mazarin" type="person">Mazarini</rs></add></orig> <note xml:id="niqm_n3w_wwb">Der Eintrag steht in keinem inhaltlichen Zusammenhang mit dem Briefkonzept, sondern dieses ist auf ein Blatt notiert, auf dem sich jener Eintrag befand.</note></seg></foreign></note> Senem annorum 76. virum <choice><abbr>opt.</abbr> <expan>optimum</expan></choice> dominum <rs corresp="ed_axl_wk5_xdb" type="person">Riverium</rs>, quicum consuetudinem familiaritatemque hic habuisti, nomine tuo salutaui. Is quoque te resalutat. <unclear cert="low" reason="illegible">medicorum</unclear> valetudine nunc utitur, et dysuria subinde laborat.</p> <postscript><p>Die <date when="1663-04-03" calendar="#Gregorian">3. <choice><abbr>April.</abbr> <expan>Aprilis</expan></choice></date> postscriptum. Hancce epistolam die 30. Martii ad dominum <rs corresp="Bidallius" type="person">Bidallium</rs> ferendam <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="words"/></del> dare non potui. Addam itaque pauca <unclear cert="low" reason="illegible">supermarb.</unclear> quam plurimis de illa <rs corresp="Beaugency" type="person">Anna Maria de Beaugenci</rs> sciscitatus sum, <add place="superlinear">qui</add> omnes <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="3" unit="chars"/></del> quamvis eorum, qui hic <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="words"/></del> aliqua fama clarent nomina probe sciant ecce prorsus ignorant. Si aliqua circunstantia illam denotare poteris aliquid fortasse detegere licebit. Ante paucos dies <del rendition="#s"><gap quantity="1" unit="words"/></del> <rs corresp="ed_bcv_ntx_tkb" type="person">ducum Mekelburgensium</rs> unus <del rendition="#s">huc</del> <rs corresp="Paris" type="place">Lutetiam</rs> <del rendition="#s">huc</del> advenit, dicunt <rs corresp="ed_vkh_b5x_tkb" type="person">uxorem</rs> hic ambire velle. Familiam numerosissimam <del rendition="#s">vestire cogitat</del> <del rendition="#ow"><unclear cert="high" reason="illegible">suisque</unclear></del> suis coloribus gentilitiis <del rendition="#s">ornare</del> vestire et ornare cogitat, vestesque confici jussit.</p></postscript> <closer><dateline><choice><abbr>Scrib.</abbr> <expan>Scribebam</expan></choice> <rs corresp="Paris" type="place"><choice><abbr>Lut. Paris.</abbr> <expan>Lutetiae Parisiorum</expan></choice></rs> die <date when="1663-03-30" calendar="#Gregorian">30. Martii 1663</date>.</dateline></closer></div></body></text>
